{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-09",
  "title": "再见，只为再见",
  "storyCode": "M8-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fb1d46aa57a7832a6fed00de03e9893abb6dfb78548f93e3d53e8dc0f9ea314a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗德岛的医疗技术......是比我们的强......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "向各个感染者聚落派遣医护人员也在我们的计划之内，但是战乱地区的话，让普通医疗干员前去，太危险了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没事，已经......可以了。这样包扎就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "敌人撤退了。战场变大了。我没法再用那个法术，找不到他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就靠我们的魔族佬吧，他们也很擅长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感谢你，罗德岛的战士。没有你的骁勇作战，我们的人员伤亡是不可避免的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我刚才听到了，罗德岛的领袖。卡特斯人，你要独自前往指挥塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......是，也不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "解释一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "面对塔露拉的时候，可能只会有我一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "也许，会有一位来自龙门的战士帮助我......但我假定只有我一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你一个人怎么杀死她？你不是大尉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但是，各位也不是。我们人越多，战斗起来就越束手束脚，何况塔露拉比爱国者先生更擅长短时间内压制战场的法术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我要带一支小队进去，只是因为指挥塔内必定也还有其他敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "够吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我相信我的小队成员。他们都是最可靠也最擅长应对各种状况的战士。如果有我们没法处理的情况，我们会征求你们的帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想将我们排除在决战之外？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不，我不想主导这次战斗，只不过，先生，游击队有只有你们才能处理的战场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想让我们阻止其他人进入指挥塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......阿米娅，你不想让我去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "在指挥塔外的战场上你会更安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不想让我和你一起战斗吗？我们两个人对抗塔露拉......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "迷迭香，塔露拉的法术饱含能量，你也许很擅长处理各种物理上的伤害方式，但是，火焰的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我......可她......她杀了Ace，杀了我那么多的亲人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我为什么不能去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不擅长......我该怎么办？我能怎么办？我以前也有很多事情不擅长的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "你恨塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然呢，不然呢！我难道不能恨她吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "迷迭香......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "你问的这些我也没有答案。我不能说你不能恨一个你没见过的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "只是，迷迭香......分别之前，我有一个命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "命令？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "命令一定要遵守......凯尔希说过，精英干员要做到。我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——Logos在我们临走前也对我说过，爱国者一生很少把别人称作强敌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "以至于他喜欢用符号、特征和装备称呼别人，反而不太用姓名和种族来代指。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但是他在刚才，他用菲林来叫你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "也许他认可你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他也这么叫你，他叫你卡特斯。认可什么？认可我这副让人害怕的样子吗？我不想被这么看待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......但是，如果说许多人把我们当作怪物，那爱国者先生已经被当作怪物很多很多年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我们的身体里都藏着可怕的法术，没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但他当我们是人。当我们是......人类。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是同类吗？都是些......可怕的，一直会被人讨厌的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不。你看看这些游击队战士，这些跟随过其他整合运动领袖的战士，我们的战士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "好的作为会赢得别人尊敬。坏的行为会被别人嫌恶讨厌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我们的所作所为才是别人判断我们的途径。就像队员们拥护你，就像盾卫拥护爱国者，就像我们愿意信任凯尔希医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "迷迭香，我的命令是，你要活下去，也要保证大家能够尽可能地活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "为此，哪怕我会死去，你也不能来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米娅！可你是......我的朋友，我怎么能让......让你一个人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不！迷迭香。我保证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我保证我也会活着回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "所以，不管有人说了什么，不管有人说我遭遇了什么，我们都要各自做主，先完成我们自己的目标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我们都要活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "这个命令，也给在场的所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "切城营救行动，是为了拯救生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "核心城潜入行动，也是为了拯救生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我们不说“为了某种事业我们能抛弃生命”，不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "生命是宝贵的，是重要的，是属于各位自己的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "没有人，没有任何一个人，能够代我们浪费掉这次生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......没有什么牺牲是必要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "这种说辞，一定是错的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Guard！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_059",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我在听，阿米娅......罗德岛的领袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "对于整合运动也是一样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡特斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯。您说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里就交给我们吧。菲林，我们走！去给这只小兔子创造一片理想的战场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......阿米娅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "一定要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道了。我一定会做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "阿米娅小队的成员们，跟我走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "各位，我们活着再见面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_059",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再见......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我们，该做我们的事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，就按游击队这一套来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们的战场可不在这一小块地方！来吧！让我们把这几条街区，全都变成我们的战区！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗德岛，走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "重复一遍，陈警司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我说的还不够清楚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "很清楚。清楚到我怀疑自己听错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "陈警员，这不在你的职权范围之内。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "法律有国度之分，公理却没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "维多利亚皇家近卫学院教了你什么？它有教你脚踏实地，不要好高骛远吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我已经毕业了。我已经是一个为龙门服务的警员了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那我重复一遍，听好，“我的志愿是加入近卫局，之后，我会加入特别督查组”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我会捍卫这座城市，也会让它变得更干净。那种事不会再发生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "哪种事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你是真的忘性很大，还是故意装傻？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "注意你的言辞，陈警员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "抱歉，长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "报告魏长官，我所指的是距今十年前，龙门遭到外部势力侵入，市民遭到绑架并自此失踪的事件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "在我加入近卫局后，我依然会推动龙门对失踪人口的进一步调查和追索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "陈......你不知道你在说什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "报告长官，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我不会反对的。那就这样吧，当你做不下去以后，就告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "陈警司，你想在近卫局干几年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我没回他。\n这么多年过来，我一直想的是，我还能干多久？我还要干多久？\n只是现在我才发现，原来这个答案，一直不是我能决定的。\n最近赤霄剑在我手里越来越钝。我得到什么时候才会理解，绝影不是逐影而行、绝不放手，而是不再回头？\n“泪锋之剑，当弃即弃。”"
    }
  ],
